      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We decided to go with Michael and the team from Solar Saving for many reasons but the single most important reason for us was an unbiased approach backed up with sound industry knowledge of the solar options available and a configuration that would best suit our needs both now and in the future.This was not a decision we made lightly and when shortlisting from a wide range of installers including some of the bigger industry players. An industry insight which we found alarming was there is an element of basis information being offered by many installers – that is recommendations to incorporate certain brand products which happen to be the installers \"industry partners\". What I found upon doing my own research was these \"industry partner\" products were not the best fit for what we as a customer were trying to achieve with our brief, and ultimately our solar setup/configuration.What became clear to us was who was giving honest advice about all available products and who was trying to manipulate our decision into a sale which would favour their \"business partners\" rather than our (the customer) needs.Micheal and the team at Solar Saving was the exception – with his honest impartial advice and sound recommendations I believe we have ended up with the best solar system for our solar needs both now and into the future.",
